sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Owner
    participant A as Attacker (reads the traffic)
    participant E as Empty replica (just restarted)
    participant H as Other replicas
    O->>E: UPDATE(v1)
    A-->>A: sees it, signs a forged v1 with the same DID and prev<br/>and a key of its own, which v0 did not commit to
    E-->>O: MissingPrevious: no version 0 to check v1 against
    A->>E: STORE(forged v1)
    E->>H: FindHash(key)
    H-->>E: 1 and hash(v1), or 0 and hash(v0)
    Note over E: R5: another version 1 refuses at once,<br/>or the fetched v0 does not commit to the forged key
    E-->>A: Conflict, nothing stored
    O->>E: replay: STORE(v0), then UPDATE(v1)<br/>or STORE(v1) once a quorum holds v1
    E-->>O: Stored, then Updated
